  "goodToKnow": "Der Mobilfunk is mobile telephony: das Mobilfunknetz, der Mobilfunkanbieter (Telekom, Vodafone, O2). Germany has long been mocked for its Funklöcher (dead zones), especially on trains and in the countryside, though coverage has improved. A mobile phone is das Handy, a pseudo-English word. Der Funk means radio transmission: der Polizeifunk. It has no plural."
